<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 7.026 pct at tender.</title>
<headline>NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 7.026 pct at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday its offer of NZ$100 million of February 2001 bonds yielded an average 7.026 percent.</p>
<p>In a tender on May 15, $100 million of the same bonds yielded an average 7.35 percent.</p>
</text>
